  { "slug": "machine-learning", "term": "machine learning", "aliases": ["ML"], "zh_name": "機器學習", "category": "concept", "langs": ["general"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "不用一條條寫規則，而是「餵大量資料讓電腦自己找規則」。給它貓狗照片，它學會分辨。", "related": ["model", "training", "neural-network", "deep-learning"] },
