  { "slug": "fine-tune", "term": "fine-tuning", "zh_name": "微調", "category": "concept", "langs": ["general"], "difficulty": 3, "plain": "拿一個「已訓練好的大模型」，再用你的專門資料多訓一點，讓它更懂你的領域。比從頭訓便宜太多。", "related": ["training", "llm", "model"] },
  { "slug": "inference", "term": "inference", "zh_name": "推論", "category": "concept", "langs": ["general"], "difficulty": 2, "plain": "「拿訓練好的模型去實際預測/回答」的過程。訓練是學、推論是用。你每次問 AI 就是一次推論（要花算力/錢）。", "related": ["model", "training", "token-ml"] },
